# Signing secrets — never commit.
# The *.bak / *.old patterns matter: a plain "*.jks" does not match "upload-keystore.jks.bak-…",
# so a rotated key's backup would otherwise be committable.
*.jks
*.jks.*
*.keystore
*.keystore.*
keystore.properties
